    <briefdescription>
<para>Convention placeholder header that pulls in <computeroutput><ref refid="dmat_8hpp" kindref="compound">dmat.hpp</ref></computeroutput> for the dense-matrix test suite. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Two-line header that exists as a stable include point for the dense-matrix tests: every <computeroutput>DMat*Test.cpp</computeroutput> (currently <computeroutput><ref refid="_d_mat_z_zp_test_8cpp" kindref="compound">DMatZZpTest.cpp</ref></computeroutput>, with more planned) reaches the engine&apos;s <computeroutput><ref refid="dmat_8hpp" kindref="compound">dmat.hpp</ref></computeroutput> through this file rather than including it directly, so future shared fixtures, helper templates, or <computeroutput><ref refid="_a_ring_c_c_c_test_8cpp_a4a618fdf0bcf2a59c823b89bd89e0ab8_1a4a618fdf0bcf2a59c823b89bd89e0ab8" kindref="member">almostEqual</ref></computeroutput>-style epsilon checks can land here without touching every test file. The pattern parallels <computeroutput><ref refid="_a_ring_test_8hpp" kindref="compound">ARingTest.hpp</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="_ring_test_8hpp" kindref="compound">RingTest.hpp</ref></computeroutput> for the coefficient-ring suites.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="dmat_8hpp" kindref="compound">dmat.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_d_mat_z_zp_test_8cpp" kindref="compound">DMatZZpTest.cpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_a_ring_test_8hpp" kindref="compound">ARingTest.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_ring_test_8hpp" kindref="compound">RingTest.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
